{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"d2d0580e06c55b9e400ab219f7145534e6a1f88cc8ea7d8b90ad9f9171320d26","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大卫在耶路撒冷的活动"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["泰尔王希兰将香柏木运到大卫那里，又差遣使者和石匠、木匠给大卫建造宫殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大卫就知道耶和华坚立他作以色列王，又为自己的民以色列，使他的国兴旺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大卫在耶路撒冷又立后妃，又生儿女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["在耶路撒冷所生的众子是沙母亚、朔罢、拿单、所罗门、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["益辖、以利书亚、以法列、"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["挪迦、尼斐、雅非亚、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以利沙玛、比利雅大、以利法列。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["战胜非利士人"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["非利士人听见大卫受膏作以色列众人的王，非利士众人就上来寻索大卫。大卫听见，就出去迎敌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["非利士人来了，布散在利乏音谷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["大卫求问 神，说：「我可以上去攻打非利士人吗？你将他们交在我手里吗？」耶和华说：「你可以上去，我必将他们交在你手里。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["非利士人来到巴力·毗拉心，大卫在那里杀败他们。大卫说：「 神借我的手冲破敌人，如同水冲去一般」；因此称那地方为巴力·毗拉心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["非利士人将神像撇在那里，大卫吩咐人用火焚烧了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["非利士人又布散在利乏音谷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大卫又求问 神。 神说：「不要一直地上去，要转到他们后头，从桑林对面攻打他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你听见桑树梢上有脚步的声音，就要出战，因为 神已经在你前头去攻打非利士人的军队。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["大卫就遵着 神所吩咐的，攻打非利士人的军队，从基遍直到基色。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["于是大卫的名传扬到列国，耶和华使列国都惧怕他。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}